  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A mace of pale steel, its head shaped like a censer and warm to the touch, kindled by Aldamir from the ember you kept faith with. It is the mark of one who has walked the first of the priest's road and tended the Secret Fire true. No greater consecration is set upon it yet -- the aura of Narya and the gifts of the full Flame are for a far greater day. Only a cleric may wield it."
    }
